3869: #   $Pre             a failure the bridge already knows (its own timeout, could not start) wins
3870: #   (detail: the terminal's reason, else the first `error:` line of stderr, else its last line)
3871: #   exit 2           failed: muse exit 2 (usage error) - <detail>, class capability
3872: #   exit 130 / 143   failed: muse exit <n> (stopped by a signal) - <detail>, class transport
3873: #   other exit != 0  failed: muse exit <n> - <terminal reason | stderr>; a reason that names the
3874: #                    step cap -> "max model steps reached", class capability; else the texts'
